# Toyota Prius XW10 four-door saloon, 2000-2003.
#
# The first mass-produced hybrid car, and a British-market model: launched at the
# British International Motor Show on 17 October 2000 at £16,495, one grade
# only, sold through about sixty Toyota Hybrid Technology Centres. Several
# secondary sources wrongly state that it was not sold in Britain.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Toyota_Prius
#
# Dimensions 4.315 x 1.695 x 1.475 m, wheelbase 2.550 m, UK NHW11.
# Source: Toyota GB second-generation Prius launch pack (2003), whose comparison
# table gives the XW10 as 4,315 x 1,695 x 1,475 m on 2,550 mm. The 2000 UK launch
# pack's 4,275 x 1,490 figures are the Japanese NHW10, a shorter, taller car with
# grey bumpers; the export car is modelled. Mirrors take the modelled width to
# 1.938 m.
#
# Colours. No UK colour list for the XW10 was located; Toyota GB's launch pack
# carries none, and the only documented finishes are the silver and dark blue the
# cars were photographed in. The objects therefore carry plain colour names
# rather than invented marketing names: silver, blue, white and red. Weights
# silver 3, blue 3, white 2, red 2, total 10, provisional pending the central
# rebase.
#
# Speed 160 km/h, the car's quoted maximum (about 99 mph). Comfort 100/330, on
# the line 180 + 1.5 x 100: a quiet, smooth saloon, but a small one with a
# continuously variable transmission. Classes 2,3.
#
# Dates are road presence: October 2000 intro, retires staggered 2016-2019 on a
# sixteen- to nineteen-year tail.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/toyota-prius-xw10.blend. Interchange:
# citycars/4.5/toyota-prius-xw10.dae (43 objects). References:
# citycars/references/toyota-prius-xw10/ (gitignored; Wikimedia Commons).
#
# Accepted deviations: the body surfaces are angular rather than the smooth
# compound curves of the real car, and the glazing is modelled as proud panels
# rather than the flush surface. At 128 px the one-box body with its short,
# steep nose and high tail reads as the first Prius.

obj=citycar
name=ToyotaPriusXW10(Silver)
copyright=JamesPetts

DistributionWeight=3
intro_year=2000
intro_month=10
retire_year=2019
retire_month=6
speed=160
class=2,3
maximum_comfortable_journey_minutes=100
maximum_tolerable_journey_minutes=330

Image[E]=./images/toyota-prius-xw10-silver_E.0.0,-33,14
Image[SE]=./images/toyota-prius-xw10-silver_SE.0.0,-13,0
Image[S]=./images/toyota-prius-xw10-silver_S.0.0,0,0
Image[SW]=./images/toyota-prius-xw10-silver_SW.0.0,-8,10
Image[W]=./images/toyota-prius-xw10-silver_W.0.0,4,5
Image[NW]=./images/toyota-prius-xw10-silver_NW.0.0,12,10
